{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49009","headline":"伤雨後牡丹 · 刘昭禹","name":"伤雨後牡丹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"废功看不已，醉起又持杯。\n数日帘常卷，中宵雨忽来。\n凄凉无戏蝶，零落在苍苔。\n造化根难问，令人首可回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘昭禹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49009.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49009","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}